{"file":"39087799.jpg","height":960,"lines":[{"confidence":1,"height":0.020500000000000001,"text":"Jeroen Verhoeven (Dutch, born 1976)","width":0.17219999999999999,"x":0.14360000000000001,"y":0.40899999999999997},{"confidence":1,"height":0.020400000000000001,"text":"Demakersvan (The Netherlands, est. 2004)","width":0.19259999999999999,"x":0.1467,"y":0.39150000000000001},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0218,"text":"With this table, Dutch design group Demakersvan has","width":0.2208,"x":0.44979999999999998,"y":0.39979999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.019699999999999999,"text":"merged traditional and advanced manufacturing","width":0.20039999999999999,"x":0.44979999999999998,"y":0.41799999999999998},{"confidence":1,"height":0.018700000000000001,"text":"Cinderella Table 2004","width":0.1328,"x":0.14380000000000001,"y":0.43959999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.021999999999999999,"text":"techniques. Using computer software, the designers","width":0.21609999999999999,"x":0.44819999999999999,"y":0.435},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0146,"text":"Birch","width":0.026599999999999999,"x":0.1406,"y":0.46039999999999998},{"confidence":1,"height":0.023199999999999998,"text":"translated sketches of the profiles of two antique","width":0.2162,"x":0.44819999999999999,"y":0.45119999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.021000000000000001,"text":"Manufactured by Demakersvan, the Netherlands","width":0.21290000000000001,"x":0.1389,"y":0.47889999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.020899999999999998,"text":"tables into digital drawings and then made a","width":0.1988,"x":0.44669999999999999,"y":0.47070000000000001},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"rendering representing the two morphing into each","width":0.2172,"x":0.44690000000000002,"y":0.49170000000000003},{"confidence":1,"height":0.022200000000000001,"text":"Gift of Marie-Josée and Henry R. Kravis in honor of","width":0.22539999999999999,"x":0.13730000000000001,"y":0.50580000000000003},{"confidence":1,"height":0.021000000000000001,"text":"other. Next, using computer-driven woodcutting","width":0.2051,"x":0.44669999999999999,"y":0.50629999999999997},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"Patricia Phelps de Cisneros, 2006","width":0.15160000000000001,"x":0.13589999999999999,"y":0.52500000000000002},{"confidence":1,"height":0.018700000000000001,"text":"machines normally employed for mass production,","width":0.22220000000000001,"x":0.44669999999999999,"y":0.5262},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0146,"text":"they fabricated the drawing as a three-dimensional","width":0.2172,"x":0.44690000000000002,"y":0.54579999999999995},{"confidence":1,"height":0.018700000000000001,"text":"object, in thin vertical sections out of sheets of birch.","width":0.2253,"x":0.44669999999999999,"y":0.56259999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.020500000000000001,"text":"Each slice was glued by hand to the next, forming a","width":0.21909999999999999,"x":0.44669999999999999,"y":0.58109999999999995},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0146,"text":"unique piece of furniture.","width":0.1109,"x":0.44529999999999997,"y":0.60209999999999997}],"ms":206.59999999999999,"width":1280}
{"file":"39088296.jpg","height":960,"lines":[{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"Jesse Louis-Rosenberg (American, born 1986)","width":0.20000000000000001,"x":0.1578,"y":0.2979},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0195,"text":"Jessica Rosenkrantz (American, born 1983)","width":0.18790000000000001,"x":0.15920000000000001,"y":0.28000000000000003},{"confidence":1,"height":0.019300000000000001,"text":"combined into one complete, complex assemblage","width":0.20349999999999999,"x":0.42480000000000001,"y":0.28810000000000002},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"in a 3D printer. To produce the dress, the client's","width":0.19689999999999999,"x":0.42499999999999999,"y":0.30420000000000003},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"Nervous System (USA, est. 2007)","width":0.1469,"x":0.15939999999999999,"y":0.31459999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.017399999999999999,"text":"body is imaged through a 3D scan, onto which the","width":0.2019,"x":0.42480000000000001,"y":0.32050000000000001},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"Kinematics Dress 2013","width":0.13439999999999999,"x":0.15629999999999999,"y":0.34370000000000001},{"confidence":1,"height":0.019699999999999999,"text":"triangular shapes that hinge together (the smaller","width":0.20349999999999999,"x":0.42330000000000001,"y":0.35189999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0146,"text":"garment surface is then digitally tessellated into","width":0.1953,"x":0.4234,"y":0.33750000000000002},{"confidence":1,"height":0.015900000000000001,"text":"Laser-sintered nylon and digital applications","width":0.183,"x":0.15459999999999999,"y":0.3644},{"confidence":1,"height":0.017899999999999999,"text":"the triangles, the more flexible and likely to drape","width":0.20180000000000001,"x":0.42330000000000001,"y":0.36830000000000002},{"confidence":1,"height":0.023599999999999999,"text":"Committee on Architecture and Design Funds, 2014","width":0.2177,"x":0.15290000000000001,"y":0.38519999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.019599999999999999,"text":"the fabric will be). The tessellation is compressed","width":0.20660000000000001,"x":0.42330000000000001,"y":0.38340000000000002},{"confidence":1,"height":0.020199999999999999,"text":"Video courtesy the designers","width":0.124,"x":0.1512,"y":0.40400000000000003},{"confidence":1,"height":0.018100000000000002,"text":"to fit the volume of the 3D printer and the form","width":0.1956,"x":0.42170000000000002,"y":0.40129999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0172,"text":"is generated using a selective laser sinter process","width":0.20799999999999999,"x":0.42180000000000001,"y":0.41870000000000002},{"confidence":1,"height":0.017100000000000001,"text":"that binds nylon powder into concrete forms. This","width":0.2049,"x":0.42180000000000001,"y":0.43509999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"Working at the intersection of math, science, and","width":0.21410000000000001,"x":0.1484,"y":0.44790000000000002},{"confidence":1,"height":0.021100000000000001,"text":"method allows garments to be customized based on","width":0.21129999999999999,"x":0.42170000000000002,"y":0.45000000000000001},{"confidence":1,"height":0.017899999999999999,"text":"technology, designers Jessica Rosenkrantz and","width":0.20799999999999999,"x":0.14680000000000001,"y":0.46379999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"clients' individual body shapes and aesthetic desires.","width":0.21249999999999999,"x":0.4219,"y":0.46870000000000001},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"Jesse Louis-Rosenberg study patterns inherent to","width":0.21560000000000001,"x":0.14369999999999999,"y":0.48120000000000002},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0172,"text":"organic forms, using them as blueprints for man-","width":0.20480000000000001,"x":0.14369999999999999,"y":0.49959999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"made printed materials. Kinematics is a branch of","width":0.21560000000000001,"x":0.14380000000000001,"y":0.51870000000000005},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"classical mechanics that investigates the motion of","width":0.21249999999999999,"x":0.14219999999999999,"y":0.53539999999999999},{"confidence":1,"height":0.020299999999999999,"text":"points and objects, a term adopted by the designers","width":0.22370000000000001,"x":0.13900000000000001,"y":0.55110000000000003},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0167,"text":"for their 4D printing system. The dress consists of","width":0.21870000000000001,"x":0.1391,"y":0.57079999999999997},{"confidence":1,"height":0.0146,"text":"over three thousand unique parts that have been","width":0.21410000000000001,"x":0.13750000000000001,"y":0.58960000000000001}],"ms":282.80000000000001,"width":1280}
